  "key_observations_html": "<div style=\"border:1px solid #C7D8E8;border-radius:10px;padding:0.75rem 0.95rem;margin:0.1rem 0 0.55rem;background:#ffffff;box-shadow:0 1px 3px rgba(15,23,42,0.06);\"><ul style=\"margin:0.1rem 0 0 1.05rem;padding:0;color:#1F4C67;font-size:0.9rem;line-height:1.45;\"><li><strong>RWA value remains network-concentrated:</strong> the top chains continue to capture the majority of distributed issuance and often set near-term market direction. Related: <a href=\"https://www.theblock.co/news/business/2026-11-12-visa-adds-western-unions-usdpt-stablecoin-to-its-settlement-network-in-anchorage-tie-up-438520\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">Visa adds Western Union\u2019s USDPT stablecoin to its settlement network in Anchorage tie-up</a> (The Block).</li><li><strong>Institutional expansion is likely staged:</strong> large-scale adoption typically lands on proven networks first, then broadens as compliance, interoperability, and liquidity deepen. Related: <a href=\"https://www.theblock.co/news/business/2026-11-12-bitgo-expands-institutional-stablecoin-minting-and-redemption-platform-with-usdc-438525\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">BitGo expands institutional stablecoin minting and redemption platform with USDC</a> (The Block).</li><li><strong>Custody and issuance integrations are moving rankings first:</strong> Chains that win custody and issuance integrations usually pull distributed value share before the broader RWA market total catches up. Related: <a href=\"https://www.theblock.co/news/business/2026-11-12-bny-taps-figment-to-support-staking-on-its-digital-asset-custody-platform-438538\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">BNY taps Figment to support staking on its digital asset custody platform</a> (The Block).</li></ul><p class=\"takeaways__note\">Context only\u2014not investment advice. Bullets combine on-page data with recent industry headlines.</p></div><p class=\"review-note ko-disclaimer\">Key observations are AI generated and should be reviewed for accuracy.</p>",
